    "text": "<p>Along the inclined plane<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi><mi>u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>v</mi><mi>u</mi></mfrac></math><br /><br />Now, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>e</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>tan</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>e</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msqrt><mi>e</mi></msqrt